dby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-07T16:32:37-08:00","id":1285721,"title":"","content":"Inari would be good. Kojin might be an interesting pick. Or maybe one of the Seven Lucky Gods?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-07T16:40:48-08:00","id":1285725,"title":"","content":"What main calling do you want? And what purview do you want to inherit?<br /> (those two questions are not always easy to answer, but they help with choosing a divine parent/patron)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-08T01:47:51-08:00","id":1285830,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wannabe Demon Lord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1285428-suggestion-wanted-for-kami-scion#post1285428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was toying around with the idea of creating a Kami scion NPC in the form of a wealthy collector of Tsukumogami, who had a huge number of them which they could utilize as minions for combat and various other purposes, Pokemon master-style. I'm not sure which Kami would be an appropriate parent/patron for such a character though. Any suggestions?</div> </div> </div> </div>Inari sounds like a good pick, as do Okuninushi/Daikokuten or Ebisu, due to all of their business associations. Ebisu, who was born from Hiruko, the abandoned first child of Izanagi and Izanami, could have an especially tantalising connection to the spirits of thrown away things. Maybe you can blend the collector part a bit with one of &quot;giving them a home&quot;, since the Tsukumogami canonically feel abandoned by humans and thus vengeful. For some extra flavour, one stories describes the Tsukumogami as worshipping a god of their own, Henge Daimyojin. He's not described in any way and is not an actual cultic figure, but maybe you'd find it cool to have the Tsukumogami sometimes whisper about him, pray to him - or maybe come to believe that their master <i>is</i> Henge Daimyojin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10624-sacerdos","name":"Sacerdos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10624_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"231"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-08T02:09:22-08:00","id":1285833,"title":"","content":"If you go with Izanagi you can have the lofty arrogance that comes with being a sibling of the Empress if Heaven rather then a son or nephew or grandchild.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}